      "id": "claim_61ce59d7d0ac4b959a356da8dc0f3c46",
      "statement": "The intended packed-token metadata contract uses a LLaMA-3 tokenizer with vocabulary size 128000, EOS id 128009, pad id 128002, and EOS appended during tokenization; these values are read from the external configuration and are not implemented or validated by the project shim.",
