    {
      "id": "claim_115b0994a8c84befb2910706b59fe14d",
      "statement": "The packed corpus uses raw headerless shard_*.bin token streams whose interpretation is controlled by manifest dtype, with EOS markers separating documents; manifest metadata includes tokenizer compatibility fields and per-shard index, path, token count, hash, and EOS count.",
