    {
      "id": "claim_289ed043e0fe4d9797ee58b37a815b98",
      "statement": "The normal packing contract does not split a document across shards, but PretrainDataset permits a training window to cross a shard boundary; the loader treats EOS as a token in a contiguous stream and does not reconstruct document records.",
