      "id": "claim_9bab8f6da53a48cd9d06fc471a057ca0",
      "statement": "PretrainDataset supports two layouts: a single file loaded as a memory-mapped torch.save tensor, and a directory of lexically sorted shard_*.bin files whose individual formats and cumulative token offsets are discovered at initialization.",
