    {
      "id": "claim_e6783e4ba02243f3960327cfa694137d",
      "statement": "The loader caches manifest eos_token_id, vocab_size, total_tokens, shard_count, and dtype but does not validate those declarations against the filesystem; malformed or unreadable manifests fall back to absent metadata and default raw-dtype behavior, so preflight compatibility checks are operationally necessary.",
